# Machine-captured evidence (CI job logs, device facts, diagnostic outputs) and
# byte-exact copies of OWNER source documents are kept exactly as captured, so
# `git diff --check` (CI FAST's whitespace gate) does not judge their
# whitespace. Product code, tests, scripts and authored docs are still checked.
artifacts/**/evidence/** -whitespace
artifacts/**/diagnostics/** -whitespace
artifacts/**/sources/** -whitespace
